\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/w9AiymbmQGt3jdtsm78HdfKkChy.jpg\",\"rating\":7,\"year\":2026,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"After a mysterious cosmic event rips Oak Street from suburbia and transports their neighborhood to someplace unknown, the Platt family soon discovers that their very survival depends on them sticking together as they navigate their now unrecognizable surroundings.\",\"genres\":[\"Sci-Fi\",\"Mystery\",\"Thriller\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":1384216,\"title\":\"The Dog Stars\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/5O616X9vmRzQdB68PHzBewPittd.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/3k7GzxOdLZkN3eZsuhLi2eRzkXO.jpg\",\"rating\":7.2,\"year\":2026,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"After the world's population has been ravaged by a pandemic, a man lives a lonesome existence in a Colorado airplane hangar with his dog and a dour gunman he has befriended. When a mysterious transmission comes through on the radio while he’s flying his old Cessna, it sparks a hunt for the provenance of the sound.\",\"genres\":[\"Action\",\"Thriller\",\"Sci-Fi\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":1400940,\"title\":\"Clayface\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/9l1NuFjel2j89hiuiJbsxfblqjy.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/f1TVhqJJdxMvUsUDuKHS0ekgYkk.jpg\",\"rating\":7.4,\"year\":2026,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"Matt Hagen's meteoric rise from Gotham street kid to Hollywood leading man is tragically cut short when a local crime boss's actions leave him horribly disfigured. Abandoned by his team and with nothing left, Matt seeks out a cutting edge treatment that miraculously returns him to his former self… but also unexpectedly affects his grip on reality, spiraling him down a destructive path of all-consuming revenge.\",\"genres\":[\"Horror\",\"Thriller\",\"Sci-Fi\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":131631,\"title\":\"The Hunger Games: Mockingjay - Part 1\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/4FAA18ZIja70d1Tu5hr5cj2q1sB.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/lV1P1Q5gLDXVG1ZYCxZHStkcQC3.jpg\",\"rating\":6.8,\"year\":2014,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"After surviving the Quarter Quell, Katniss finds herself in the hidden stronghold of District 13, where the rebellion against the Capitol is gaining momentum. Struggling with the weight of becoming the symbol of resistance, she must navigate fragile alliances while trying to protect those she loves. As propaganda battles rage and Panem moves closer to full-scale war, Katniss is forced to confront the true cost of revolution.\",\"genres\":[\"Sci-Fi\",\"Adventure\",\"Thriller\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":1265609,\"title\":\"War Machine\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/rFhKkXhk7ClU03jQ5rHIApJDwev.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/6yeVcxFR0j08vlv2OlL6zbewm4D.jpg\",\"rating\":7.5,\"year\":2026,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"On one last grueling mission during Army Ranger training, a combat engineer must lead his unit in a fight against a giant otherworldly killing machine.\",\"genres\":[\"Action\",\"Sci-Fi\",\"Thriller\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":198663,\"title\":\"The Maze Runner\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/ode14q7WtDugFDp78fo9lCsmay9.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/eTlcNXGv32zkVI7ZDHhfeaKHXKQ.jpg\",\"rating\":7.2,\"year\":2014,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"A teenager with no memory of his past finds himself among a group of boys living in a walled enclosure surrounded by a massive, ever-changing maze. As he struggles to adapt to their rules and society, he begins to uncover clues that may lead to escape and the truth behind their confinement.\",\"genres\":[\"Action\",\"Mystery\",\"Sci-Fi\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":840464,\"title\":\"Greenland 2: Migration\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/z2tqCJLsw6uEJ8nJV8BsQXGa3dr.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/cLFbDVfhllIMybpo2fkGNz